        "totalPages": 2,
        "preview": false
      },
      "videos": [
        {
          "label": "參考演奏：Shin Izumi",
          "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UvwfWxI97ao"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "name": "Shin Izumi",
        "url": ""
      },
      "notes": "電影《菊次郎的夏天》主題曲，Shin Izumi 的編曲。\n・標準調弦、Capo 2，♩ = 92\n・開頭整段 P.M.（悶音）分解和弦，右手掌根輕靠琴橋\n・中段的搥音（H）與勾音（P）要乾淨，不要搶拍",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-19T08:10:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T16:27:59.804Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "like-a-star",
      "title": "Like A Star",
      "titleZh": "",
      "artist": "Youngso Kim 金永所",
      "arranger": "林慶義 Chi-Yi Lin（探吉日）",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "status": "練習中",
      "tuning": "cgdgad",
      "capo": 2,
      "bpm": 60,
      "key": "",
      "tags": [
        "韓國指彈",
        "探吉日",
        "特殊調弦"
      ],
      "techniques": [
        "alternate-tuning",
        "harmonics",
        "hammer-on",
        "pull-off",
        "slide",
        "capo"
      ],
      "chords": [],
      "highlights": "- 調弦是 C G D G A D：6 弦降到 C、5 弦降到 G、2 弦降到 A、1 弦降到 D，見 [[technique:alternate-tuning]]。\n- 全曲的泛音記號超過一百個，大部分是 12 格的自然泛音（譜上寫 <12>），另有十幾個人工泛音（AH）：[[technique:harmonics]]。\n- 前奏是自由拍（Free time），♩ = 60 只是參考；譜上有標運指的段落是老師覺得容易卡住的地方，先慢練。\n- 旋律靠搥、勾、滑串起來：[[technique:hammer-on]]、[[technique:pull-off]]、[[technique:slide]]。",
      "cover": "media/covers/like-a-star.jpg",
      "pdf": {
        "path": "media/tabs/like-a-star.pdf",
        "pages": 10,
        "totalPages": 10,
        "preview": false
      },
      "videos": [
        {
          "label": "探吉日 TAB 示範：林慶義",
          "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hvikpVxTFcE"
        },
        {
          "label": "原曲 MV：Youngso Kim",
          "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ukM_JPc1LNE"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "name": "探吉日 Tanji Day",
        "url": "https://www.tanjidayguitar.com/"
      },
      "notes": "探吉日林慶義老師採譜，譜上有很詳細的左手運指。\n・特殊調弦：①=D ②=A ⑤=G ⑥=C（③④弦不變），Capo 2\n・♩ = 60，前奏是自由拍（Free time）\n・譜上有標運指的段落都是容易卡住的地方，先慢速練熟",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-19T08:20:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T18:24:17.702Z"
    },
